WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.164 --> 00:00:10.364
In tutorial 6.3, you'll finish
a page that needs your edits,

00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:11.948
and get it ready to publish.

00:00:12.969 --> 00:00:18.293
First, open Content. When a draft needs
your edits, the summary at the top says so.

00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:24.053
On the board, its card says
Needs your edits, in red.

00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:26.497
Click See what to edit to open its report.

00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:30.898
The report says the draft
isn't ready to publish yet,

00:00:30.948 --> 00:00:32.964
and how many brackets are left for you.

00:00:34.944 --> 00:00:38.644
Scroll down to the red box.
It lists what the check found,

00:00:38.694 --> 00:00:41.735
every bracket to edit by
hand, and your next step.

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:48.030
Brackets are details only you can give,
like a real price, a claim to confirm,

00:00:48.080 --> 00:00:49.878
or an example from your own work.

00:00:50.923 --> 00:00:53.898
In the page preview, every
bracket is highlighted,

00:00:53.948 --> 00:00:55.986
so you can spot each one in the text.

00:00:57.944 --> 00:01:02.830
Not sure what to do? Click How to finish
it, for a short guide, one step at a time.

00:01:05.448 --> 00:01:09.073
Now download the draft
as a Word or HTML file,

00:01:09.123 --> 00:01:12.342
and fill in or delete each
bracket in your own copy.

00:01:13.398 --> 00:01:17.598
There's no need to write the page again.
Put the finished page on your website,

00:01:17.648 --> 00:01:19.659
then click I published this page.

00:01:21.419 --> 00:01:26.654
The form already knows which page it is.
Check the address, click Check the page,

00:01:26.704 --> 00:01:29.625
and Alaventra checks it
live and starts tracking it.

00:01:30.610 --> 00:01:34.640
So, open the page that needs
edits, see what to edit and why,

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:36.670
then fill the blanks and publish it.

00:01:38.089 --> 00:01:42.839
Your draft is ready to go live. Next,
check any page before you publish it,

00:01:42.889 --> 00:01:44.752
in tutorial 6.4.
